thread:
The thread is the cyan wave mark from the logo: a gradient sine squiggle (#49D8ED to #9EE6FD) ending in a dot. It always means 'a connection':
- S1: it is born from a dot on frame 0 and links two people on 'great connections'.
- S2: it snaps, slides along a contour into a dead end, and falls short as a flat dashed line.
- S3: it lands home after 'Málaga' in the logotype.
- S4: it chains the community cards together.
- S5: it writes 'Málaga∿.' at the summit.
- S6: it underlines the local venue.
- S8: it draws spokes back to the speaker, then runs down the paths that open to the member pills.
- S9: it becomes the group's avatar and the chat's typing indicator.
- S10: it underlines career / business / inspiration and flies over the risen peaks, looking.
- S11: it arcs across the valley to the next connection.
- S12: it comes out of the JOIN US pill and lands after 'Málaga' again.

Under it, the topographic map is the stage, and it changes with the story:
- it forms around the first dot;
- it crowds into steep walls (the problem);
- it relaxes (Meet);
- it rings every person who appears;
- it converges into one summit (Málaga);
- it parts around banners and into paths;
- it turns pale on the white pages;
- it lifts into a 3D landscape for the viewer's ambitions;
- on 'grow together', all its peaks rise and their contour rings merge into shared ones.
